.el .ds Aq '
.TH FATHOM_EXPORT 1  "fathom 0.1.0-alpha.1" 
.SH NAME
fathom\-export \- Write a review artefact for a pull request or an audit
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfathom export\fR [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-\-episodes\fR] [\fB\-\-root\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-stdout\fR] [\fB\-\-strict\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write a review artefact for a pull request or an audit
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: markdown]
The artefact format: markdown, html or json
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fI<OUT>\fR [default: fathom\-review]
The file stem to write, or a file name that already carries the format\*(Aqs extension
.TP
\fB\-\-episodes\fR \fI<EPISODES>\fR [default: HEAD]
The episode range to export, e.g. `HEAD~9..HEAD`, one commit, or one episode id
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR \fI<ROOT>\fR [default: .]
The repository to read
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the report as JSON on stdout, and nothing else there
.TP
\fB\-\-stdout\fR
Write the artefact to stdout instead of a file; the report goes to stderr
.TP
\fB\-\-strict\fR
Exit 7 while the artefact\*(Aqs checklist still has an open item — the form a CI gate wants
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
